  m_Name: firstFireTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialStep
  stepId: firstFireTutorial
  title: Fires
  body: 'A fire has a chance of starting when the weather is Drought or Heatwave.\n

    It
    burns quicker and has a smaller chance to spread when it is on an empty Soil.
    When it fully burns a Soil it can''t be burnt again for some time.\n

    Use
    your Water tool or hope for Rain to stop the fire!'
  image: {fileID: 0}
